.TH DANBY-WINDPENDULUM 1
.SH NAME
danby-windpendulum \- pendulum under steady aerodynamic torque
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B danby/windpendulum
.SH MODEL
An angle-dependent wind torque competes with gravity, shifting the equilibrium
and, at sufficient wind loading, removing the original stable position.
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/danby/plugin/windpendulum.b
